Package: BioDyn
Type: Package
Title: BioDyn: Spatiotemporal and Environmental Exploration for Biodiversity
        Occurrence Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Tiago A.", "Herrador", email = "tiago.alejo.h@hotmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Carla A.", "Reati", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Provides tools to support reproducible workflows for the
  spatiotemporal exploration of species occurrence data in ecology and
  biogeography. The package integrates data ingestion, construction of
  presence-absence datasets, spatial filtering and user-defined
  segmentation, environmental raster enrichment, and diagnostic
  visualization. BioDyn helps users assess sampling effort and bias and
  explore intra-specific spatial and temporal patterns prior to formal
  ecological modeling.
